| **Testing** | Cypress: https://docs.cypress.io/ |
| **Accessibility** | axe-core: https://github.com/dequelabs/axe-core |
| **CI/CD** | Vercel GitHub Actions: https://vercel.com/docs/platform/deployments/github-actions |

---

### Final Thought

Building a robust e‑commerce frontend is a marathon, not a sprint. Start small—get a minimal viable product (MVP) up and running, then iterate based on real user feedback. Keep your code modular, test-driven, and well‑documented, and you’ll have a scalable foundation that can grow with your business.

Happy coding! 🚀
